62, 325.36749267578125], "pos": [1519.5003662109375, 2018.6959228515625], "widgets_values": ["A serene Japanese healing-style illustration depicts a soft and adorable anthropomorphic orange tabby cat, exuding warmth and charm. The cat wears a cozy white knitted sweater adorned with subtle cat paw patterns, complemented by a matching cat ear headband perched cutely on its head. Sitting gracefully on a rustic wooden bench beneath a full-bloom cherry blossom tree, the tabby cradles a steaming cup of caramel macchiato in its gentle paws, the steam curling softly into the air. Pink cherry blossom petals drift down like whispers of spring, resting delicately on its head and shoulders, adding a magical touch to the scene.\n\nThe cat's bright, sparkling light brown eyes radiate innocence and joy, while a faint blush colors its cheeks, enhancing its endearing expression. Behind it, the cherry blossom tree stretches wide, its blossoms forming a canopy of soft pinks and whites, resembling clouds illuminated by sunlight. Petals scatter across the ground, mingling with an open comic book whose pages flutter slightly in the breeze, hinting at a moment of quiet relaxation.\n\nThe overall ambiance is imbued with a soft and warm color palette, blending pastel pinks, creamy whites, and gentle browns. Delicate, fluid lines bring a sense of calm and smoothness to the composition, while subtle shading adds depth and texture. The scene captures the essence of springtime serenity, evoking feelings of peace, renewal, and quiet joy, as though time itself has paused to savor the tranquil beauty of the moment."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 163, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 124, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [173], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name":